TEXT 0 544 Left 2 ;Common-emitter amplifier with emitter degeneration: gain = -(Rc || RL)/(Re + re), about -3.1\nR1, R2 set the base at Vcc*R2/(R1+R2) = 2.1 V, so Ic = (2.1 V - 0.65 V)/Re = 1.4 mA and V(col) = 5.5 V
